  "主要内容": "On April 6, 2018, the U.S. Treasury designated Vladimir Bogdanov for his involvement in the Russian Federation’s energy sector. Bogdan, as Director General and Vice Chairman of Surgutneftegaz, a vertically integrated oil company, had his assets frozen under U.S. jurisdiction. The Treasury also imposed sectoral sanctions on Surgutneftegaz under Directive 4 issued under E.O. 13662 in September 2014. Sergey Fursenko, a board member of Gazprom Neft, a subsidiary of state-owned Gazprom, was designated under Executive Order 13661 for his role as an official of the Russian Federation government. These designations are part of broader sanctions measures against Russian entities and individuals involved in malign activities.",
